OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FOutbreaks of showery rain
OL,6,Fmoving through during the morning,
OL,7,Fperhaps heavy. Dry and rather warm in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon with some bright spells,
OL,9,Fthough clouding over again in the west
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FUnsettled at first with spells of
OL,14,Fheavy rain at times and brisk winds.
OL,15,FSettling down for Wednesday, with
OL,16,Fspells of sunshine and temperatures
OL,17,Faround the seasonal average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
